<div class="calcpad-output">
 <!-- Section properties of a trapezoid: area, centroid offsets, $I_x$, $I_y$, section moduli and radii of gyration from the two parallel sides and height. -->
 <h1>Geometrical Properties of Trapezoid</h1>
 <div style="max-width:130mm">
  <img alt="Trapezoid.png" class="side" src="Images/mechanics/sections/trapezoid.png" style="height:135pt;"/>
 </div>
 <p>Dimensions</p>
 <p>
  Bottom base -
  <span class="eq">
   <var>a</var>
   = 2
   <i>m</i>
  </span>
  , Top base -
  <span class="eq">
   <var>b</var>
   = 1
   <i>m</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  Height -
  <span class="eq">
   <var>h</var>
   = 1
   <i>m</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>Area</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>A</var>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>h</var>
    ·  (
    <var>a</var>
    +
    <var>b</var>
    )
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    1
    <i>m</i>
    ·  ( 2
    <i>m</i>
    + 1
    <i>m</i>
    )
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   = 1.5
   <i>m</i>
   <sup class="unit">2</sup>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>Centroid</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>y</var>
   <sub>c</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    <var>a</var>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc">
    2
    <i>m</i>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    2
   </span>
   = 1
   <i>m</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>z</var>
   <sub>c</sub>
   =
   <span class="dvc up">
    <var>h</var>
    ·
    <span class="dvc">
     <var>a</var>
     + 2 ·
     <var>b</var>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     <var>a</var>
     +
     <var>b</var>
    </span>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    3
   </span>
   =
   <span class="dvc up">
    1
    <i>m</i>
    ·
    <span class="dvc">
     2
     <i>m</i>
     + 2 · 1
     <i>m</i>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     2
     <i>m</i>
     + 1
     <i>m</i>
    </span>
    <span class="dvl">
    </span>
    3
   </span>
   = 0.444
   <i>m</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>Perimeter</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>P</var>
   =
   <var>a</var>
   +
   <var>b</var>
   + 2 ·
   <span class="o1">
    <span class="r1">
    </span>
    <var>h</var>
    <sup>2</sup>
    +
    <span class="dvc">
     (
     <var>b</var>
     −
     <var>a</var>
     )
     <sup>2</sup>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
   </span>
   = 2
   <i>m</i>
   + 1
   <i>m</i>
   + 2 ·
   <span class="o1">
    <span class="r1">
    </span>
    1
    <i>m</i>
    <sup>2</sup>
    +
    <span class="dvc">
     ( 1
     <i>m</i>
     − 2
     <i>m</i>
     )
     <sup>2</sup>
     <span class="dvl">
     </span>
     4
    </span>
   </span>
   = 5.24
   <i>m</i>
  </span>
 </p>
 <p>Second moments of area</p>
 <p>
  <span class="eq">
   <var>I</var>
   <sub>y</sub>
